{
  "source": "Prompts/when-you-need-more-7.mp4",
  "duration": 192.725625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.02,
      "end": 3.54,
      "text": "For many tasks, open your AI app, ask your question,"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.9,
      "end": 5.24,
      "text": "and keep the conversation going."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.06,
      "end": 8.3,
      "text": "But some tasks ask more of AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.88,
      "end": 11.86,
      "text": "You might need help working through a complicated plan,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.18,
      "end": 15.3,
      "text": "weighing several options, or investigating information"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.3,
      "end": 16.64,
      "text": "across different sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.28,
      "end": 18.88,
      "text": "Depending on the app and your subscription,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.52,
      "end": 22.26,
      "text": "you have three other choices to handle that complexity."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.14,
      "end": 25.44,
      "text": "The model, thinking, and research."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.92,
      "end": 27.64,
      "text": "You won't need to change them every time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.64,
      "end": 30.28,
      "text": "but knowing what they do helps you get a better answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.26,
      "end": 32.72,
      "text": "These advanced settings aren't magic."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.24,
      "end": 35.58,
      "text": "They are simply different ways to instruct the AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.58,
      "end": 38.04,
      "text": "to work harder on your specific problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.76,
      "end": 40.1,
      "text": "Let's look at the first option,"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.46,
      "end": 43.58,
      "text": "which focuses on the underlying engine of the app itself."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.54,
      "end": 47.08,
      "text": "This board shows what changing the model does."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.02,
      "end": 50.1,
      "text": "An LLM powers the app's answers."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.78,
      "end": 53.72,
      "text": "Choosing a model selects which LLM engine to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.44,
      "end": 55.12,
      "text": "Start with the default."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.78,
      "end": 58.86,
      "text": "On the left, the everyday model is for simple tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.56,
      "end": 61.96,
      "text": "Ask, suggest a funny movie to watch tonight."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.72,
      "end": 65.92,
      "text": "On the right, the more capable model is for demanding tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.44,
      "end": 68.64,
      "text": "Ask, help me plan a summer business,"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.0,
      "end": 72.06,
      "text": "including costs, pricing, and how many customers I'll need."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.78,
      "end": 75.72,
      "text": "Upgrading the model is about changing the actual entity"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.72,
      "end": 77.02,
      "text": "that processes your prompt,"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.38,
      "end": 80.18,
      "text": "giving you a heavier duty engine when the details require it."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.68,
      "end": 82.12,
      "text": "We just changed the engine."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.66,
      "end": 84.2,
      "text": "Now let's look at a different tool,"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.2,
      "end": 87.84,
      "text": "one that controls the amount of time the AI is allowed to work."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.68,
      "end": 90.58,
      "text": "This next board illustrates thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.32,
      "end": 94.1,
      "text": "This setting strictly changes how much time"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.1,
      "end": 95.86,
      "text": "the AI spends working through the task."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.44,
      "end": 99.82,
      "text": "On the left, with less thinking, the AI spends less time."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.42,
      "end": 102.78,
      "text": "Ask, turn these notes from our group meeting"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.78,
      "end": 103.82,
      "text": "into a clear checklist."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.92,
      "end": 107.38,
      "text": "On the right, more thinking forces the AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.38,
      "end": 108.96,
      "text": "to weigh options for analysis."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.88,
      "end": 112.8,
      "text": "Ask, help us divide this project among four people."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.8,
      "end": 114.76,
      "text": "We have one week, different schedules,"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.28,
      "end": 117.34,
      "text": "and only two people know how to edit video."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.06,
      "end": 119.46,
      "text": "By increasing the thinking time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.78,
      "end": 122.48,
      "text": "you ensure the AI forces itself to show its work,"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.84,
      "end": 125.86,
      "text": "allowing it to untangle complex, multi-step logic"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.86,
      "end": 127.62,
      "text": "before it generates the final response."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.78,
      "end": 131.44,
      "text": "Sometimes extra time and a better engine aren't enough."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.04,
      "end": 134.4,
      "text": "You need the AI to look completely outside"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.4,
      "end": 136.08,
      "text": "its own internal knowledge base."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.86,
      "end": 138.48,
      "text": "Our final board defines research."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.18,
      "end": 141.4,
      "text": "While a regular chat looks up basic facts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.4,
      "end": 144.08,
      "text": "this dedicated mode synthesizes information"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.08,
      "end": 144.98,
      "text": "from different websites."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.26,
      "end": 149.08,
      "text": "On the left, use regular chat just to get an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.62,
      "end": 150.96,
      "text": "Ask, I live in Dallas."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.52,
      "end": 153.74,
      "text": "How long would it take me to drive to Texas A&M"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.74,
      "end": 155.68,
      "text": "in college station versus UT Austin?"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.72,
      "end": 158.66,
      "text": "On the right, use deep research"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.66,
      "end": 160.72,
      "text": "to build a report that shows sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.32,
      "end": 162.94,
      "text": "Ask, I want to study physics"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.94,
      "end": 165.74,
      "text": "and am considering Texas A&M and UT Austin."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.24,
      "end": 167.34,
      "text": "Compare their physics programs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.14,
      "end": 169.16,
      "text": "undergraduate research opportunities,"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.16,
      "end": 171.02,
      "text": "admissions requirements, and costs."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.6,
      "end": 172.08,
      "text": "Show your sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.18,
      "end": 175.1,
      "text": "Research is the correct choice"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.1,
      "end": 177.96,
      "text": "when your primary goal is to verify accuracy"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.96,
      "end": 182.02,
      "text": "and pull facts from multiple independent external sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.96,
      "end": 183.96,
      "text": "Remember our three settings."
    },
    {
      "start": 184.82,
      "end": 186.66,
      "text": "Model, thinking, and research."
    },
    {
      "start": 187.64,
      "end": 189.14,
      "text": "Use them when the work demands more."
    }
  ],
